url: "https://github.com/CuiLinWEJ/uniGas_membrane_TdualFlux"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-08-10
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
abstract: >-
  A post-thesis research prototype containing modifications to a uniGasFoam
  permeable-membrane boundary implementation. The current source supports
  probabilistic reflection/transmission, side-dependent membrane temperatures,
  bidirectional transmitted-particle statistics, cyclic-direction rollback
  handling, and membrane-force output for rarefied-gas simulations.
  Comprehensive physical validation is ongoing.
keywords:
  - DSMC
  - rarefied gas dynamics
  - OpenFOAM
  - uniGasFoam
  - permeable membrane
  - particle transmission
  - aerodynamic force
  - numerical simulation
